  "remarks": "Open Joint Stock Company “All-Russian Scientific Research, Design and Technological Institute of Relay Construction with pilot production” is a Russian company which is part of the ABS Electro group of companies and which is involved in developing and manufacturing electronic and radio-electronic components. Open Joint Stock Company “All-Russian Scientific Research, Design and Technological Institute of Relay Construction with pilot production” is owned by LLC “Assets Electro”, a company which shares the same management and ownership structure as Limited Liability Company “Asset Automation”, the company holding the trademark under which the ABS Electro group of companies operate. Along with Limited Liability Company “Asset Automation”, Open Joint Stock Company “All-Russian Scientific Research, Design and Technological Institute of Relay Construction with pilot production” also owns shares in LLC “ABS ZEIM Automation” . ABS Electro group also includes JSC VNIIR-Progress, a Russian research and development institute that produces the Kometa antenna used in devices such as the Shahed and Geran unmanned aerial vehicle and guided bomb kits to enhance their resistance against electronic interference.",
